# Route: guide 48 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 38 quests, 0.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Undercity, Tirisfal Glades, Western Plaguelands, Thunder Bluff):
# Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity ->
# near Undercity -> Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity -> The Bulwark ->
# Dalson's Tears -> The Bulwark -> The Writhing Haunt -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Book of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going,
# Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The
# Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice
# (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of Power (96988), Vorrel's Revenge
# (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The
# Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment
# (97288), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald
# (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors
